1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Subtitles: Moonrise team
www.moonrise-subs.net

2
00:02:16,714 --> 00:02:20,593
Send the photos to ellen.marsh@gmail.com.

3
00:02:21,083 --> 00:02:24,924
He said he would call after work.

4
00:02:53,620 --> 00:02:56,352
The train leaves at seven.

5
00:02:58,316 --> 00:03:01,848
Your grandmother, in 1962.

6
00:03:02,165 --> 00:03:05,293
Is your brother coming tonight?

7
00:03:06,247 --> 00:03:08,698
Not now. Later.

8
00:03:11,160 --> 00:03:14,563
I told you the bridge was closed.

9
00:03:21,738 --> 00:03:24,420
There's someone on the road.

10
00:03:26,598 --> 00:03:30,595
"Call now or visit
bestmattress-deals.com!"

11
00:03:32,852 --> 00:03:35,628
The garage roof leaks.

12
00:03:36,242 --> 00:03:39,530
Let's go. We're late.

13
00:03:41,419 --> 00:03:43,901
Stop the car!

14
00:03:45,115 --> 00:03:48,552
You said that last month.

15
00:03:49,928 --> 00:03:52,643
What is it?

16
00:03:53,668 --> 00:03:56,351
It's raining again.

17
00:03:57,750 --> 00:04:00,297
The soup is too hot.

18
00:04:02,373 --> 00:04:06,030
The play was directed by my uncle.

19
00:04:08,203 --> 00:04:10,845
I'll fix it on Sunday.

20
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:17,287
Version 2.0 is worse, e.g. the menus.

21
00:04:18,446 --> 00:04:21,512
We landed late.It was cold.

22
00:04:23,876 --> 00:04:27,144
Pass me the salt, please.

23
00:04:35,866 --> 00:04:38,689
Twice. He still looks hungry.

24
00:04:39,804 --> 00:04:44,083
We need to leave before it gets dark.

25
00:04:45,924 --> 00:04:49,665
I can't sleep with the window open.

26
00:04:51,769 --> 00:04:55,471
I found the letter in the attic.

27
00:04:57,470 --> 00:05:00,939
On the table, next to the lamp.

28
00:05:01,670 --> 00:05:04,107
Read it to me.

29
00:05:06,342 --> 00:05:09,593
Then we take the long road.

30
00:05:11,655 --> 00:05:14,598
Wait, I forgot my coat.

31
00:05:14,826 --> 00:05:18,611
Where did you put the keys?

32
00:05:20,922 --> 00:05:23,132
Then set an alarm.

33
00:05:24,082 --> 00:05:26,413
You always say that.

34
00:05:28,136 --> 00:05:30,037
Who wrote it?

35
00:05:30,899 --> 00:05:33,483
Close it, then.

36
00:05:35,313 --> 00:05:39,313
Subtitles by DUNEFOX
[dunefox.subs@mailbox.org]

